{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目のシングルの選抜発表がありましたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目の選抜はこのメンバーでいきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は選抜、十福神に選んで頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は最近"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がどういう事が出来るのか、したいのかを探しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"探してみると、武器（特技とか魅力とか）無くて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武器が無いからやりたい事も見つけることが出来なくて。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんなは綺麗で、可愛くて、武器があって、確実に力がついて来ている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は何ができるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何があるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうおもって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビに出させて頂く時は映してもらえる様にいっぱい発言してみたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでは煽りをやってみたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目を気にして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエットしたり、髪型を考えてみたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しづつですが、自分をよくする為に考える様になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48チームBとの兼任をすることになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"兼任をするって決めた時。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の自分を変えたいから、きっと力がつくって思って決めた所もあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のままじゃダメなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分はこのままのレベルでは消えてしまう。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が大好きだからメンバーでいたいし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に必要な存在になりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからその為には今与えられているチャンスを次に繋げれるようにする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もこの場所でチャンスを頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから一生懸命頑張る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジション下がったとか言うけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はそれよりも自分を高めていく事が出来る今を全力で戦いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな自分だって出来るんだ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って証明出来るように！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ればその分出来るようになるよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はもう前みたいにぴーぴー泣いたりくよくよしないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までの自分のそういう所が大嫌い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の悪いところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもいっぱいあるけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ前よりはメンタル強くなったと思いますよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから大丈夫ですよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は結構考え方とか変わったな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々自分を高める為に必死です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんどうか私を見て下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに見たい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援したいって思ってもらえる様な存在になりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"43人でひとつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"坂を登ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈"}],"source":"archive"}